"✓ Index statistics: total entries, unique entries, size\n".echo();
"✓ Performance metrics: last updated, consistency\n".echo();
"✓ Storage information: index size, compression\n".echo();
"\n".echo();

"Index Maintenance:\n".echo();
/* This would be the new syntax for GrapaDBX */
/*
